## Inductance sample: half-torus coil + workpiece + air domain
## Required labels: source, sink (sidesets on terminal faces)
## Optional labels: coil, workpiece, air
##
## Half-torus coil with cylindrical workpiece inside, surrounded by
## cubic air domain. For BEM EFIE + SIBC induction heating analysis.
##
## Geometry:
##   Coil: half-torus (R_major=0.11 m, R_minor=0.01 m)
##   Workpiece: cylinder (R=0.05 m, H=0.06 m) at center
##   Air: cube (0.3 m side)
##
## Analytical reference (full torus, no workpiece):
##   L = mu_0 * R * (ln(8R/a) - 2) = 342.4 nH (full), ~181 nH (half)
##
## Usage: Solve -> Radia-NGSolve -> Induction Heating

reset

# Create torus coil (R_major=0.11 m, R_minor=0.01 m)
create torus major radius 0.11 minor radius 0.01

# Cut with YZ plane to create terminal faces
webcut volume 1 with plane xplane noimprint nomerge

# Delete one half to get a C-shape (half-torus)
delete volume 2

# Workpiece: cylinder at center (R=0.05 m, H=0.06 m)
create cylinder height 0.06 radius 0.05

# Air domain (cube, 0.3 m side, centered at origin)
brick x 0.3 y 0.3 z 0.3

# Conformal interface between all volumes
imprint all
merge all

# Mesh coil
volume 1 scheme tetmesh
volume 1 size auto factor 5
mesh volume 1

# Mesh workpiece
volume 3 scheme tetmesh
volume 3 size auto factor 5
mesh volume 3

# Mesh air
volume 4 scheme tetmesh
volume 4 size auto factor 3
mesh volume 4

# Material blocks
block 1 add volume 1
block 1 name "coil"
block 2 add volume 3
block 2 name "workpiece"
block 3 add volume 4
block 3 name "air"

# Terminal faces (created by webcut, on coil)
sideset 1 add surface 2
sideset 1 name "source"
sideset 2 add surface 3
sideset 2 name "sink"
